          "en": "how the signIn process should work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.83,
          "end": 92.47,
          "en": "And specifically here, we can add a redirect field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.47,
