          "end": 109.91,
          "en": "next JS would redirect us to another page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.91,
          "end": 111.64,
          "en": "to an error page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.64,
          "end": 113.36,
          "en": "And to this something we could utilize,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.36,
          "end": 115.75,
          "en": "we can then set up such an error page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.75,
          "end": 117.97999999999999,
          "en": "and we can configure that error page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.97999999999999,
          "end": 120.06,
          "en": "You can check out the next options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.06,
          "end": 122.9,
          "en": "for the credentials provider to learn more about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.9,
          "end": 126.55,
          "en": "But more often you typically wanna leave the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.55,
          "end": 128.75,
          "en": "on the page where he or she is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.75,
          "end": 131.63,
          "en": "and just shows some error message there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 131.63,
          "end": 133.39,
          "en": "So, if we are logging in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.39,
          "end": 136,
          "en": "I don't want to be redirected If it fails.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136,
          "end": 138.67000000000002,
          "en": "I maybe just want to show an overlay",
